		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60005","type":"group","label":"VApp (Electron)","x":-1220,"y":-1220,"width":400,"height":250,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5061000","type":"text","text":"# musui\nThai AI VTuber / Streamer\nProduction MVP · Python FastAPI · Monorepo","x":-190,"y":-1180,"width":380,"height":110,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5061001","type":"text","text":"## Gateway :8000\nHealth · Status · WebSocket hub\n`services/gateway/`","x":-160,"y":-980,"width":320,"height":85},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5061002","type":"text","text":"## YouTube :8001\nChat ingestion (mock / live)\nNormalizes → `ChatMessage`\n`services/youtube/`","x":-160,"y":-820,"width":320,"height":100},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5061003","type":"text","text":"## Orchestrator :8002\nDecision engine · Cooldown logic\nCoordinates all downstream services\n`services/orchestrator/`","x":-160,"y":-640,"width":320,"height":100},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5061004","type":"text","text":"## Moderation :8003\nThai-first rules engine\n10 label categories:\nspam · sexual · harassment · hate\ndoxxing · self-harm · illegal…\n`services/moderation/`","x":-600,"y":-460,"width":300,"height":140},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5061005","type":"text","text":"## Persona :8004\nYAML-driven prompt builder\nMood & energy state tracking\n`services/persona/`","x":280,"y":-460,"width":300,"height":100},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5061006","type":"text","text":"## LLM Response :8005\nGenerates short Thai replies\nPersona + memory + safety context\n`services/llm_response/`","x":-160,"y":-250,"width":320,"height":100},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5061007","type":"text","text":"## TTS :8006\nText-to-speech synthesis\nRVC voice model adapter\n`services/tts/`","x":-160,"y":-70,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5061008","type":"text","text":"## Avatar Bridge :8007\nViseme + expression events\nEmotionTag → animation\n`services/avatar_bridge/`","x":-480,"y":110,"width":290,"height":100},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5061009","type":"text","text":"## OBS Bridge :8008\nScene control · Subtitles\nAudio playback commands\n`services/obs_bridge/`","x":190,"y":110,"width":290,"height":100},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f506100a","type":"text","text":"## Data Logging :8009\nStores messages, replies, latencies\nEval traces for offline replay\n`services/data_logging/`","x":-160,"y":300,"width":320,"height":100},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f506100e","type":"text","text":"### namwa.yaml\n**น้องน้ำหวาน** (Namwa)\nMoods: calm · excited · teasing\nfocused · chaotic\nThai-first · max 3 sentences","x":280,"y":-280,"width":290,"height":120},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f506100f","type":"text","text":"### moderation/rules.yaml\nslang_map · regex_rules\nSeverity 0-3 · Action mappings","x":-600,"y":-240,"width":280,"height":80},
		{"id":"c1d2e3f40607100e","type":"text","text":"## Tests\n`test_decision_engine.py`\n`test_moderation.py`\n`fixtures/response_examples.json`","x":-160,"y":490,"width":320,"height":100},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f506100b","type":"text","text":"## Redis :6379\n**Streams:**\n`streamer.chat.events`\n`streamer.reply.events`\n`streamer.avatar.events`\n**Pub/Sub:** `streamer.obs.commands`","x":880,"y":-680,"width":310,"height":160},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f506100c","type":"text","text":"## PostgreSQL :5432\n`stream_sessions`\n`chat_messages`\n`moderation_results`\n`bot_replies`\n`event_logs`\n`viewer_memory`","x":880,"y":-440,"width":310,"height":180},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f506100d","type":"text","text":"## Docker Compose\n`docker-compose.yml`\n`python-service.Dockerfile`\n11 services orchestrated","x":880,"y":-170,"width":310,"height":100},
		{"id":"c1d2e3f406071000","type":"text","text":"## Domain Models\n`ChatMessage` · `ModerationResult`\n`ReplyDecision` · `TTSRequest`\n`VisemeEvent` · `SceneCommand`\n`shared/ai_streamer/models/domain.py`","x":-1190,"y":-680,"width":330,"height":130},
		{"id":"c1d2e3f406071001","type":"text","text":"## RedisEventBus\nxadd streams · publish pub/sub\n`shared/ai_streamer/bus.py`","x":-1190,"y":-470,"width":330,"height":80},
		{"id":"c1d2e3f406071002","type":"text","text":"## Config & Logging\nShared config · Structured logging\n`shared/ai_streamer/config.py`\n`shared/ai_streamer/logging.py`","x":-1190,"y":-310,"width":330,"height":100},
		{"id":"c1d2e3f406071003","type":"text","text":"**mosui** ★ primary\n`mosui.pth` · `mosui.index`","x":880,"y":175,"width":310,"height":65},
