		{"id":"c1d2e3f40607100a","type":"text","text":"## VTube AI (Electron)\nConnects LM Studio + VTube Studio + TTS\nWebSocket / HTTP bridges\n`VApp/src/main.js`\n`VApp/renderer/index.html`","x":-1190,"y":-1185,"width":350,"height":140},
		{"id":"c1d2e3f40607100b","type":"text","text":"## Speech to Text\nGoogle STT + OpenAI Whisper\n`speech to text/`","x":-1190,"y":230,"width":350,"height":80},
		{"id":"c1d2e3f40607100c","type":"text","text":"## TTS Scripts\npyttsx3 · edge-tts · RVC310 pipeline\n`scripts/tts_with_*_rvc310.py`","x":-1190,"y":330,"width":350,"height":80},
